sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Meetily
    participant Connector as Meetily Connector
    participant Backend as QALY Backend
    participant AIGW as AI Gateway
    participant API as AI API
    participant DB as SQL Server

    User->>Meetily: Record/transcribe/summarize meeting
    Meetily-->>Connector: Export transcript + summary
    Connector->>Backend: POST /api/meetings/import
    Backend->>DB: Save import session
    Backend->>AIGW: Create extract action-items job
    AIGW->>AIGW: Check cache + budget + schema
    AIGW->>API: Extract JSON keywords/actions/deadlines
    API-->>AIGW: Structured JSON
    AIGW->>DB: Save usage ledger/cache
    Backend->>DB: Save AI draft
    Backend-->>User: Show draft + sources
    User->>Backend: Confirm/edit generated tasks
    Backend->>DB: Create official tasks
